 "kind": "statement",
 "title": "Triple-overlap cocycle",
 "statement": "On every triple overlap, the composite of the $(i,j)$ and $(j,k)$ overlap\nisomorphisms equals the $(i,k)$ overlap isomorphism.",
 "source": {
  "document": "literature/blueprint/master/blueprint/sec-nagata-compactification/sk-def-nagata-sketch-data/lemma-nagata-global-blowup-overlap-cocycle.md",
